SUMMARY:Dia de Muertos Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Davis Pride will present an altar dedicated to trans lives lost during 2026. If you are interested in honoring an ancestor or a group of people lost this year\, submit your interest here https://forms.gle/SwrSpa7koa2gK7g49. Hosted on November 1 from 4 – 7 p.m. at E Street Plaza in Davis. There will be dance performance\, face painting and more.
